  "notes": "Cash basis county. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Beginning cash is not printed (only beginning fund balance 2,693,265 and net position), so beginning_cash is null; ending cash 3,176,790 from Equity in Pooled Cash (p3). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund (Exhibit F pp5-6), Road Fund (Exhibit G p7), Inheritance Tax (Exhibit H p8) budget schedules; nonmajor special revenue funds from the Schedule 3 combining pages (pp10-11, more detailed than the Schedule 4 budget totals pp12-13, which are not recorded to avoid double counting); Building fund from Schedule 2 (p9). General Fund Taxes 891,420 (p5, final budget 899,169) split into Property Taxes 843,204 and Motor Vehicle Tax 48,216 using the General column of Exhibit D (p4). Veteran's Aid and Drug Law Enforcement funds had no activity. Read pages 1-13 of 13."
